      "t": "2026-11-07T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "Six people are killed and 15 more injured in a drive-by mass shooting in the center of Kraków, Poland. The perpetrator, who also killed his parents and his sister at their home in Ostrowiec Świętokrzyski…",
      "cites": [
